{"ordinal":12208,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453533147137","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Eyes_DontShoot_0ffa8d3","source":"Esenin: Это же пиздец...","target":"Esenin: E de căcat…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-308.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12209,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453533147136","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Eyes_DontShoot_0b417f8","source":"Esenin: Я не могу понять, как у тебя рука поднимается, чтобы направлять на кого-то ружьё...","target":"Esenin: Nu pricep cum îți dă mâna să îndrepți pușca spre cineva…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-308.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12210,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453528952837","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Eyes_DontShoot_0961ee5","source":"Esenin: ...","target":"Esenin: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-308.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12211,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453528952836","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Eyes_DontShoot_0ef70dc","source":"Esenin: Но я не к этому. Я к тому, что как только ты опустишь ружьё после такой хуйни, так тебя бы отпиздили знатно.","target":"Esenin: Dar nu despre asta vorbesc. Zic că, după ce lași pușca jos după o asemenea porcărie, te-ar bate zdravăn.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-308.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
